        <mxCell id="aJ2HDceCKY1dvYnu8gbP-51" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;: Nol atau Banyak (Zero or Many)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="185" x="345" y="585" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aJ2HDceCKY1dvYnu8gbP-52" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Pada Garis layanan dan pesanan:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;angka 1 disisi Layanan dan 0..* di sisi pesanan.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Artinya satu layanan dapat dipesan berkali&quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;dan setiap pesanan memuat tepat satu layanan&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="213" x="307" y="635" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aJ2HDceCKY1dvYnu8gbP-53" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;roundedPerimeter=1;fillColor=none;align=left;fontColor=default;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;• Setiap pesanan memuat tepat satu layanan (Pesanan.id_layanan adalah foreign key ke Layanan.id_layanan).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;• Satu layanan dapat dipesan oleh banyak pesanan (nol atau lebih).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;• Users menyimpan akun admin dan berdiri sendiri, tidak memiliki foreign key ke tabel lain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;• Status pesanan: Menunggu dan Selesai disimpan di database, sedangkan Proses ditentukan oleh method tentukanStatus() berdasarkan jadwal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
